    "body": "I couldn't quite understand this warning at first, what is a select flow? After discussion with @annevk I understand it's (for example) the provisioning flow for a new eSIM, and nothing to do with `<select>`.\n\nA warning that user agents should take great care about exposing this information and leaving it up to the UA how to gate it would be better.",
